Competition is a animation, family film directed by Julien Soret.

2
00:01:00,000 --> 00:01:06,000
Two minions working in a bomb lab get competitive.

3
00:01:30,000 --> 00:01:36,000
Minion (voice), played by Pierre Coffin.

4
00:02:00,000 --> 00:02:06,000
Minion (voice), played by Chris Renaud.

5
00:02:30,000 --> 00:02:36,000
Despicable Me is an American media franchise created by
Sergio Pablos, Cinco Paul and Ken Daurio.

6
00:03:00,000 --> 00:03:06,000
It centers on a supervillain turned secret agent named Gru, his adoptive
daughters, Margo, Edith, and Agnes, and his yellow-colored Minions.

7
00:03:30,000 --> 00:03:36,000
The franchise is produced by Illumination and distributed
by its parent company Universal Pictures.

8
00:04:00,000 --> 00:04:06,000
The franchise began with the 2010 film of the same name, which was followed by three sequels, Despicable Me 2 (2013), Despicable Me
3 (2017), and Despicable Me 4 (2024) and two spin-off prequels, Minions (2015) and Minions: The Rise of Gru (2022).

9
00:04:30,000 --> 00:04:36,000
The franchise also includes many short films, a television special,
several video games, and a theme park attraction.
